Provider and agent icons in this folder are bundled for local, offline use.

- Most SVGs are copied from yetone/magpie's `internal/gui/assets/icons`,
  which is MIT licensed. Copyright belongs to the respective brand owners.
- The icon set originates from LobeHub Icons (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons),
  MIT licensed.
- The Magpie brand mark (`magpie.svg`) belongs to the Magpie project.

They are used only to identify the corresponding provider, agent or model.
All trademarks remain the property of their owners.

